<div class="view" id="view-plantillas">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-badge">Boilerplates · Código Base</div>
      <h1><em>Plantillas</em> de Código</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Repositorios base, boilerplates y ejemplos para acelerar el desarrollo de aplicaciones en Banco BASE.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a onclick="navigate('catalogo')"> Catálogo</a> <span>/ Plantillas</span></div>
    <div class="filters" id="pla-filters">
      <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">Todas</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="backend">Backend</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="frontend">Frontend</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="infra">Infraestructura</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="docker">Docker</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="kustomize">Kustomize</button>
    </div>
    <div class="templates-grid" id="pla-templatesGrid"></div>
    <div class="guide-section">
      <div class="guide-header" onclick="toggleGuide()">
        <h2>Guía: Construcción de manifiestos con Kustomize</h2>
        <span class="guide-expand" id="guideExpand">▼</span>
      </div>
      <div class="guide-body" id="guideBody">
        <p style="margin-bottom:24px;">Kustomize permite personalizar manifiestos de Kubernetes sin templates. Sigue esta estructura estándar.</p>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-title"><span class="step-number">1</span> Estructura de directorios</div>
          <div class="structure-tree"> app-mi-servicio/<br>├──  base/<br>│   ├── deployment.yaml<br>│   ├── service.yaml<br>│   ├── configmap.yaml<br>│   └── kustomization.yaml<br>└──  overlays/<br>    ├──  dev/<br>    │   ├── kustomization.yaml<br>    │   └── patch-replicas.yaml<br>    ├──  qa/<br>    └──  prod/</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-title"><span class="step-number">2</span> base/kustomization.yaml</div>
          <div class="code-block"><code>apiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1
kind: Kustomization
resources:
  - deployment.yaml
  - service.yaml
  - configmap.yaml
commonLabels:
  app: mi-servicio
  managed-by: kustomize</code></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-title"><span class="step-number">3</span> Overlay dev (overlays/dev/kustomization.yaml)</div>
          <div class="code-block"><code>apiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1
kind: Kustomization
resources:
  - ../../base
namespace: dev
patches:
  - target:
      kind: Deployment
      name: mi-servicio
    patch: |-
      - op: replace
        path: /spec/replicas
        value: 1</code></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-title"><span class="step-number">4</span> Comandos útiles</div>
          <div class="code-block"><code># Ver resultado
kustomize build overlays/dev

# Aplicar
kubectl apply -k overlays/dev/

# Diferencia entre entornos
kustomize build overlays/dev | diff - <(kustomize build overlays/prod)</code></div>
        </div>
        <div class="note-box"><strong>Recomendación Banco BASE:</strong> Usa esta estructura para todas las aplicaciones. Los overlays por ambiente permiten mantener la base limpia.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-footer">¿Necesitas una plantilla específica? <a onclick="navigate('solicitar')" style="cursor:pointer">Solicítala →</a></div>
  </div>
</div>

